el Niihashi and Ninny Spangcole. They are protection agents for Wing Bind (WB), an organization for dragon conservation and management. Their mission is to protect and manage the dragons within London on behalf of the people.\n\n(Source: Official Site)\n\nNote: The show was screened in theaters and released online on the same date; the theatrical release combines all three episodes into one."},"tags":[{"name":"Witch","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":71,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Work","rank":69,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Idol","rank":43,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban","rank":13,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"BURN THE WITCH","english":"BURN THE WITCH","native":"BURN THE WITCH","romaji":"BURN THE WITCH","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"龙与魔女"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"バーン・ザ・ウィッチ"}]},"trailer":{"id":"VnQZcum2se4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VnQZcum2se4/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}